<view class="add-page safe-bottom">
  <view class="header"><text class="h1">发现更多酒吧</text><text class="desc">搜索腾讯地图真实 POI，或在微信地图中手动选点。新增门店默认标为“待核实”。</text></view>
  <view class="search-box"><input class="query" placeholder="输入广州酒吧名称" value="{{query}}" bindinput="onInput" confirm-type="search" bindconfirm="search" /><button class="search-btn" bindtap="search" loading="{{loading}}">搜索</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{hint}}" class="hint">{{hint}}</view>
  <view class="results" wx:if="{{candidates.length}}">
    <view class="label">真实地点搜索结果（请核对地址与名称）</view>
    <view class="candidate" wx:for="{{candidates}}" wx:key="poiId">
      <view class="item-info"><text class="name">{{item.name}}</text><text class="sub">{{item.address}}</text></view>
      <button class="insert" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="addCandidate">＋ 加入</button>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="manual"><view class="label">不用密钥也能添加</view><text class="desc">直接打开微信真实地图，在广州区域搜索并选择店铺，取得准确经纬度。</text><button class="choose" bindtap="choosePoint">在地图中选取酒吧</button></view>
  <view class="selection" wx:if="{{pending}}"><text class="label">即将加入的门店</text>
    <input class="entry" value="{{newName}}" bindinput="changeName" placeholder="酒吧名称" maxlength="80" />
    <text class="sub">{{pending.address}}</text>
    <picker mode="selector" range="{{stationChoices}}" value="{{stationIndex}}" bindchange="stationChange"><view class="entry">附近地铁站：{{stationChoices[stationIndex]}}　▾</view></picker>
    <picker mode="selector" range="{{lineChoices}}" value="{{lineIndex}}" bindchange="lineChange"><view class="entry">对应线路：{{lineChoices[lineIndex]}}　▾</view></picker>
    <button class="save" bindtap="saveNewBar">确认添加到本机地图</button>
  </view>
  <view class="footnote">当前新增酒吧只保存在本机微信存储中，卸载后可能丢失。下一阶段可接入云数据库、编辑审核和账号同步。</view>
</view>
